11
01:23:11,250 --> 01:23:17,250
Mystery Road is a 2013 Australian crime film with neo-Western
elements and setting, written and directed by Ivan Sen.

12
01:30:45,000 --> 01:30:51,000
It was screened in the Special Presentation section at the
2013 Toronto International Film Festival.

13
01:38:18,750 --> 01:38:24,750
A film sequel entitled Goldstone was released in 2016, and TV series in 2018, all featuring
Aaron Pedersen as the brooding Indigenous Australian detective Jay Swan.

14
01:45:52,500 --> 01:45:58,500
The film explores themes of australia, detective, sniper
rifle, outback, australian aboriginal.

15
01:53:26,250 --> 01:53:32,250
The tone is emotional and intense.
